sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Editor (admin UI)
    participant B as Subblog backend
    participant V as Viewer (browser/agent)

    rect rgb(232, 242, 255)
    Note over E,B: PHASE 1 · UPLOAD — encrypt before storage
    E->>B: POST /api/upload?encrypted=1 (multipart)
    B-->>E: 200 + storageRef + encryptedKey (base64)
    Note over E,B: ciphertext .bin → R2 · keys only in DB
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 230)
    Note over V,B: PHASE 2 · PUBLIC TEASER — cover only
    V->>B: GET /writing/:slug
    B-->>V: isLocked: true · body/media/key nulled<br/>cover + excerpt only
    end

    rect rgb(232, 255, 235)
    Note over V,B: PHASE 3 · PROOF-GATED READ — decrypt on proof
    V->>B: GET /api/nibgate/media/:postId/photo?index=N
    B-->>V: 402 + x402 payment challenge
    V->>B: retry + x-nibgate-payment-proof header
    Note over V,B: fetch .bin from R2 → decrypt server-side
    B-->>V: 200 plaintext · Cache-Control: private
    end
